+# optimizer_adamw_fold task's contract: the LOCAL norm, bytes identical to TE's kernel; the
+# square, the all-reduce, the root and the coefficient below stay as shipped).  The module is the
+# one AK_X9_KERNEL_DIR names (harness/tier2/x9_adamw/fused_adamw_master.py), the same file whose
+# step() the distributed optimizer runs.  Rank 0 prints one ARMED line at the first norm.
